iji044-031","person_id":"t0l_25p_ekd","title":"相魏","kind":"unclassified","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p044","quote":"十二年，楚敗我襄陵。諸侯執政與秦相張儀會齧桑。十三年，張儀相魏。魏有女子化爲丈夫。秦取我曲沃、平周。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji044-031:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p044","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"相魏","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m044-0027","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"用稱、授予、追尊與任事分存；爭太子、俘虜與死亡不推持有或全部有效終點。原紀年未換算，惠王敘事與追尊王號並存，版本及制度種類待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji044-077","person_id":"t0l_25p_ekd","surfaces":["張儀"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-044-wei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p044","quote":"十二年，楚敗我襄陵。諸侯執政與秦相張儀會齧桑。十三年，張儀相魏。魏有女子化爲丈夫。秦取我曲沃、平周。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p045","quote":"十六年，襄王卒，子哀王立。張儀復歸秦。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p049","quote":"九年，與秦王會臨晉。張儀、魏章皆歸于魏。魏相田需死，楚害張儀、犀首、薛公。楚相昭魚謂蘇代曰：『田需死，吾恐張儀、犀首、薛公有一人相魏者也。』代曰：『然相者欲誰而君便之？』昭魚曰：『吾欲太子之自相也。』代曰：『請爲君北，必相之。』昭魚曰：『柰何？』對曰：『君其爲梁王，代請説君。』昭魚曰：『柰何？』對曰：『代也從楚來，昭魚甚憂，曰：「田需死，吾恐張儀、犀首、薛公有一人相魏者也。」代曰：「梁王，長主也，必不相張儀。張儀相，必右秦而左魏。犀首相，必右韓而左魏。薛公相，必右齊而左魏。梁王，長主也，必不便也。」王曰：「然則寡人孰相？」代曰：「莫若太子之自相。太子之自相，是三人者皆以太子爲非常相也，皆將務以其國事魏，欲得丞相璽也。以魏之彊，而三萬乘之國輔之，魏必安矣。故曰莫若太子之自相也。」』遂北見梁王，以此告之。太子果相魏。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p050","quote":"十年，張儀死。十一年，與秦武王會應。十二年，太子朝於秦。秦來伐我皮氏，未拔而解。十四年，秦來歸武王后。十六年，秦拔我蒲反、陽晉、封陵。十七年，與秦會臨晉。秦予我蒲反。十八年，與秦伐楚。廿一年，與齊、韓共敗秦軍函谷。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為及同段連續語境；外黃徐子／客按同一勸還對話暫接，龐涓／涓按同一馬陵戰暫接。孫子與孫臏、公子赫與襄王、齊王與齊宣王仍分候選；武下將識國別待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p044","text":"十二年，楚敗我襄陵。諸侯執政與秦相張儀會齧桑。十三年，張儀相魏。魏有女子化爲丈夫。秦取我曲沃、平周。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m044-0010","start":10,"end":14,"surface":"諸侯執政","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱與未定指代保留；公中緩爭太子不作已授太子，將識國別及孫子身份待核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m044-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"t0l_25p_ekd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m044-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"t0l_25p_ekd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m044-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"女子","kind":"person","person_id":"hw7_g75_oiz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m044-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"丈夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱與未定指代保留；公中緩爭太子不作已授太子，將識國別及孫子身份待核。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p045","text":"十六年，襄王卒，子哀王立。張儀復歸秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m045-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m045-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"哀王","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAAA*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m045-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"t0l_25p_ekd","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p049","text":"九年，與秦王會臨晉。張儀、魏章皆歸于魏。魏相田需死，楚害張儀、犀首、薛公。楚相昭魚謂蘇代曰：『田需死，吾恐張儀、犀首、薛公有一人相魏者也。』代曰：『然相者欲誰而君便之？』昭魚曰：『吾欲太子之自相也。』代曰：『請爲君北，必相之。』昭魚曰：『柰何？』對曰：『君其爲梁王，代請説君。』昭魚曰：『柰何？』對曰：『代也從楚來，昭魚甚憂，曰：「田需死，吾恐張儀、犀首、薛公有一人相魏者也。」代曰：「梁王，長主也，必不相張儀。張儀相，必右秦而左魏。犀首相，必右韓而左魏。薛公相，必右齊而左魏。梁王，長主也，必不便也。」王曰：「然則寡人孰相？」代曰：「莫若太子之自相。太子之自相，是三人者皆以太子爲非常相也，皆將務以其國事魏，欲得丞相璽也。以魏之彊，而三萬乘之國輔之，魏必安矣。故曰莫若太子之自相也。」』遂北見梁王，以此告之。太子果相魏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"秦王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、假設人稱與未名者保留；游説中扮演梁王不當昭魚本人身份，安陵氏與阿衡不補熟知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"t0l_25p_ekd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"魏章","kind":"person","person_id":"pha_cmo_p9d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"田需","kind":"person","person_id":"2qe_ml9_mta","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"t0l_25p_ekd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":"oiy_a5y_l1t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"薛公","kind":"person","person_id":"7qj_amj_139","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"昭魚","kind":"person","person_id":"g4n_b86_xmr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"蘇代","kind":"person","person_id":"9yz_2do_3dm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"田需","kind":"person","person_id":"2qe_ml9_mta","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"t0l_25p_ekd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":