"person","person_id":"y9g_4wy_1m9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0335","start":335,"end":337,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_4wy_1m9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0347","start":347,"end":349,"surface":"梁王","kind":"person","person_id":"4yy_xd0_rft","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m049-0355","start":355,"end":357,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_4wy_1m9","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p050","text":"十年，張儀死。十一年，與秦武王會應。十二年，太子朝於秦。秦來伐我皮氏，未拔而解。十四年，秦來歸武王后。十六年，秦拔我蒲反、陽晉、封陵。十七年，與秦會臨晉。秦予我蒲反。十八年，與秦伐楚。廿一年，與齊、韓共敗秦軍函谷。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m050-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"t0l_25p_ekd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m050-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"秦武王","kind":"person","person_id":"0tz_6h5_zmv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m050-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_4wy_1m9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m050-0047","start":47,"end":50,"surface":"武王后","kind":"person","person_id":"ek7_zwf_lkt","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-044","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei","source":{"title":"史記／卷044","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷044","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷044&oldid=7903606","revision_id":7903606,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"70段正文；排除現代章節標題、斠勘空段與版權告示，只去除段落外緣空白。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署